  "content": "\n\n<h1>中毒附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> \n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fpoisoning-enchantment-data-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/poisoning-enchantment?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> \n<a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"License\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>專為劍設計的全新<code>中毒</code>附魔，命中目標時會施加中毒效果。</p>\n<p>此附魔最高等級為 II，每提升一級都會增加效果的持續時間。</p>\n<p>您可以透過附魔台、戰利品箱或與村民交易來獲得此附魔。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>獲取：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot poisoning_enchantment:poisoning_&lt;level&gt;</code></pre>\n<p>附魔：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s poisoning_enchantment:poisoning &lt;level&gt;</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/enchantments-data-pack/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤與問題回報</h2>\n<p>請在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 中回報任何問題或錯誤。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>💌 贊助</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Ko-Fi 上贊助</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 PayPal 上贊助</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器託管</h2>\n<p>自行架設伺服器可能是一個耗時、繁瑣且昂貴的過程。</p>\n<p>但使用 BisectHosting，只需點擊幾下即可擁有您的專屬伺服器！他們提供全天候客服支援與快速回應服務，絕不讓任何問題阻礙您的腳步！感興趣嗎？我們為您準備了專屬優惠！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fb